		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Radioddity GD-73 - Not supported]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2751&amp;p=22592#p22592"><![CDATA[
This radio is currently not supported<br><br>It uses a different DMR and CPU chip, HR-C7000, instead of the HR-C6000 and separate CPU.<br><br>There is no publised Software Development Kit (SDK) for the HR-C7000, so at this time development for any radio which uses this IC is impossible<br><br>Additionally<br><br>* There is no published schematic for this radio.<br>* The display type used in this radio is unknow<br>* The radio only has a few buttons, and only a small display,  so the full features of the OpenGD77 firmware would never be possible<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Mar 14, 2023 12:28 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
